    <header class="not-prose mb-8"><p class="eyebrow">Guide</p><h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl">Wood + pellet stoves in 2026</h1><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-500">Last reviewed {lastReviewed} · ~7 min read</p></header>
    <p class="lede">Wood and pellet stoves are still a viable choice in rural and cold-climate homes — especially as supplemental heat alongside a heat pump. This guide covers what they cost installed, EPA certification requirements, the wood-vs-pellet tradeoff, and when each makes sense vs a heat pump primary.</p>
